  "ruleText": "Saf-C 1314.09 Additional Lights. Sufficient lights shall be placed inside a school bus to illuminate the lift area.\n\nSource. #8248, eff 1-4-05 (from Saf-C 1313.09); ss by #10439, eff 10-11-13 (see Revision Note #1 at chapter heading for Saf-C 1300); ss by #14005, eff 6-22-24, EXPIRES: 6-22-34 (see Revision Note #2 at chapter heading for Saf-C 1300)",
